  <div class='row'>
    <h1 class='topic col-sm-12'>Overview</h1>
  </div>
  <div class='row'>
    <div class='col-sm-12'>
      <p>OL COPC renders Cloud Optimized Point Clouds (COPC) on OpenLayers maps with WebGL, top-down or in a tilted view that shows buildings and terrain in 3D. Only the points needed for the current view are loaded, so even point clouds with hundreds of millions of points can be shown. It is completely free, Open Source JavaScript, released under the Apache 2.0 license.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
